761-
762:1. **Never commit state files** - They contain session tokens
763-   ```bash
764-   echo "*.auth-state.json" >> .gitignore
765-   ```
--
776-   rm -f ./auth-state.json
777-   ```
778-
779:4. **Use short-lived sessions for CI/CD**
780-   ```bash
781-   # Don't persist state in CI
782-   agent-browser open https://app.example.com/login
